.widget_preview/

# Provider source and commercial media are never repository artifacts. Keep
# only deliberately authored, license-approved starter content under assets/.
/Free50/**/*.mp4
/Free50/**/*.gif
/private_media/
/provider_source_media/
**/license_documents/
**/purchase_records/
